        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.589,
            0.673,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": "comes to rest pointing at one of the numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, and these are equally likely outcomes. What is the probability that it will point at"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.666,
            0.261,
            0.686
          ],
          "content": "(i) 8?"
